One very important reason is that savescumming allows you to save before
you enter a new level, and try over and over again until you get a nice
level, with lots of special rooms, and no difficult enemies.

Also, once you have a blessed scroll of identify, you can just save, and
try that scroll over and over again until it works. The same could even
work (but that's even more tedious) when you have a ring of polymorph and
amulet of unchanging, but no ring of polymorph control. Just save and
restart until you change into something nice, then put on your amulet.

Cheating like this could be done in many different ways. In short, you can
disable the RNG by save scumming.

